  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2102.24 “Valid ADS worker certificate” means an asbestos disposal worker certificate issued pursuant to RSA 141-E:11 and Env-A 1812 that has not expired or been suspended or revoked.\n\nSource. #12605, eff 9-1-18",
